                            ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Rename the group demo-team to demo-crew.                   ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║     Configurations such as sudoers address a group by its    ║                            
                            ║     name and keep the old one; they stop working until they  ║                            
                            ║     are changed too. You can undo this under Host > Changes. ║                            
